    "faq": "Frequently asked questions",
    "faqSubtitle": "Everything you need to know about shopping on MOVELI",
    "faqQ1": "What payment methods do you accept?",
    "faqA1": "We accept TBC and Bank of Georgia (BOG) debit/credit cards and cash on delivery.",
    "faqQ2": "How does cash on delivery work?",
    "faqA2": "Choose \"Cash on delivery\" at checkout. Pay the courier in cash when your order arrives. Available for orders in Tbilisi. No additional fee applies.",
    "faqQ3": "How long does delivery take?",
    "faqA3": "Tbilisi: 1–2 business days. Regions: 2–5 business days via Georgian Post. You'll receive tracking information by SMS once your order is shipped.",
    "faqQ4": "How much does shipping cost?",
    "faqA4": "Tbilisi: Free for orders over ₾100, otherwise ₾5. Regional delivery: ₾15 via Georgian Post.",
    "faqQ5": "Can I return a product?",
    "faqA5": "Yes. You have 14 days from the date of delivery to return any product for a full refund, no questions asked. The product must be in its original condition and packaging. Some exceptions apply (opened hygiene products, personalized items, perishables).",
    "faqQ6": "How do I track my order?",
    "faqA6": "Go to My Orders in your account. Each order shows its current status. Once shipped, you'll see tracking information for Georgian Post or courier deliveries.",
    "faqQ7": "Is my payment information secure?",
    "faqA7": "Yes. We never store your card details. All payments are processed through certified payment gateways (TBC Pay / BOG iPay) with SSL encryption.",
